cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kalanos in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Kalanos: data quality grading for robot training datasets"
abstract: >-
  Kalanos grades robot training data before it is used for training. It scores
  every recording and the dataset as a whole for timing, signal integrity and
  motion quality, producing a 0-100 score, an A-F grade and a train-ready
  verdict, with each finding traced to the episode, stream and channel it came
  from. It reads LeRobot, HDF5, MCAP (ROS 2), CSV and JSON recordings, infers
  schemas for undocumented formats, and needs no labels.
authors:
  - name: "Kalanos AI"
    website: "https://kalanos.ai"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-24"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://kalanos.ai"
